      "source": "Convenient superclass when we want to force subclasses to\nimplement MethodMatcher interface, but subclasses\nwill want to be pointcuts. The getClassFilter() method can\nbe overridden to customize ClassFilter behaviour as well.",
      "translation": "当我们需要强制子类实现 `MethodMatcher` 接口，但子类又希望作为切入点时，这是一个方便的父类。还可以重写 `getClassFilter()` 方法来自定义 `ClassFilter` 的行为。",
      "count": 2
    },
